# sherpa-onnx supply-chain record
#
# The sherpa-onnx AAR is built on demand by JitPack from GitHub source
# (no Maven Central signatures), so the exact binaries are pinned here.
# CI verifies these hashes BEFORE any gradle build; a mismatch fails the
# build (tag moved, rebuild, or compromise).
