#
# NOTE: only the AAR below is consumed by the build (app/build.gradle
# coordinate com.github.k2-fsa.sherpa-onnx:sherpa-onnx:1.13.8). The
# sherpa-onnx-jvm jar was previously listed here but is unused, so it is
# no longer fetched or verified.
#
# To upgrade: change the version in app/build.gradle, download the new
# artifacts from the URLs below, update the hashes + commit, and push.

